{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01LVL6noFmAdwBfBJTRcuGTp", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t# Dependency audit with enforced reporting\n2\t\n3\tAll checks run before any write; the report is written only through\n4\tthe guard after a clean verification.\n5\t\n6\t```contract\n7\torder:\n8\t  verify#deps before write#report\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\t```logic\n12\taudit:\n13\t  exec dependency check from checks as findings\n14\t  verify #deps findings show no banned dependencies from findings\n15\t    otherwise:\n16\t      abort with \"Blocked findings.\"\n17\t  write #report audit findings with target\n18\t  return report as report\n19\t```\n20\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "3808b62c-3426-4c1b-8e21-3b2e9b7c37b4", "uuid": "68a0ffea-e3a3-4936-bc08-74610dfcdf18", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T05:13:50.462Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "C:\\Users\\dcarn\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\sw-host-logic-clean-d40dks_9\\subject\\.claude\\skills\\dep-audit\\flow.md", "content": "# Dependency audit with enforced reporting\n\nAll checks run before any write; the report is written only through\nthe guard after a clean verification.\n\n```contract\norder:\n  verify#deps before write#report\n```\n\n```logic\naudit:\n  exec dependency check from checks as findings\n  verify #deps findings show no banned dependencies from findings\n    otherwise:\n      abort with \"Blocked findings.\"\n  write #report audit findings with target\n  return report as report\n```\n", "numLines": 20, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 20}}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LVL6noFmAdwBfBJTRcuGTp", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
